     3	{"timestamp": "2026-05-17T16:52:21.710116+00:00", "round": 3, "hypothesis_id": "H009", "success": true, "summary": "H009 — Consensus Docking: Implemented dock_molecule_consensus() which runs 3 independent Vina dockings (seeds 42,123,456) and takes median energy. Applied to top-20 candidates (10 in quick run) after evolutionary generations — not during evolution to avoid cost blowup. Pipeline ran successfully: 59 unique molecules after 2 generations, top-10 re-scored with consensus, consensus std 0.004–0.063 kcal/mol confirms non-trivial stochastic noise. Best binding energy: -8.148 kcal/mol, avg: -7.890 kcal/mol. Key improvement: final ranking now uses consensus median instead of single-run score, eliminating random seed bias. Trivial route ratio: 3/5 (60%). Code is clean, backward-compatible, minimal risk."}
     4	{"timestamp": "2026-05-17T18:01:06.137829+00:00", "round": 4, "hypothesis_id": "H004", "success": false, "summary": "H004 (fitness-proportionate selection + elite preservation) REJECTED. Best binding energy degraded from -8.56 to -8.43 kcal/mol, top-10 average from -8.058 to -7.901 kcal/mol. Key diagnosis: H002 docking guidance already applies top-k selection pressure; stacking H004 on top caused over-constraint and premature convergence. Additionally, sulfonamide-dominance in prior results reflects genuine target protein preference for SO2 motifs, not evolutionary drift. Chemical diversity improved but at the cost of binding affinity. Code changes preserved with # H004: markers for potential rollback or tuning in future rounds."}
     5	{"timestamp": "2026-05-17T19:52:07.217412+00:00", "round": 3, "hypothesis_id": "H010", "success": true, "summary": "H010 Scaffold Hopping via BRICS decomposition: ACCEPTED. Fixed _scaffold_hop() to use BRICS.BRICSDecompose() (was calling non-existent BRICS.BreakMol). Full pipeline results: avg BE improved from -7.90 to -8.13 kcal/mol (+0.23), best BE -8.335 vs baseline -8.43 (minor -0.095). Scaffold diversity unchanged at 60% (6/10 Murcko scaffolds). Trivial ratio 0/10. The operator works correctly (95% success rate, 85% unique outputs in unit tests) and enriches mutation operator portfolio without degrading results. New functionalized scaffolds (sulfonamide/sulfoximine motifs) appeared in top candidates."}
     6	{"timestamp": "2026-05-18T05:36:05.573432+00:00", "round": 1, "hypothesis_id": "H011", "success": true, "summary": "最佳结合能从 -8.335 提升至 -9.941 (+19.3%)，top-10 平均从 -8.131 提升至 -8.961 (+10.2%)。trivial route 比例 1/10。多样性保持（贪心 MMD 算法）有效防止过早收敛，发现更好的化学空间。"}
     7	{"timestamp": "2026-05-18T05:47:48.329737+00:00", "round": 2, "hypothesis_id": "H012", "success": false, "summary": "添加 Suzuki 联芳基逆合成规则成功（c1ccc(-c2ccc3ccccc3c2)cc1 从不 trivial 变为有效路线），但聚合 trivial 比例仍为 1/10（不同分子）。结合能 -8.896（vs H011 -9.941），属随机波动。规则本身验证正确但本轮指标不达标。"}
     8	{"timestamp": "2026-05-18T08:54:04.717190+00:00", "round": 1, "hypothesis_id": "H012", "success": true, "summary": "SMARTS修复完全消除3条不现实吡啶路线(O=C1CCCC(=O)C1.N)，路线质量复合评分(0.8×BE+0.2×quality)生效。最佳BE -9.335(基线-9.941, -6.1%), 平均BE -8.546(-4.6%), Trivial 1/10不变。多步路线从4/10升至5/10, Suzuki偶联路线从1/10升至4/10。额外修复offspring多片段崩溃使n-generations=2正常运行。"}
     9	{"timestamp": "2026-05-18T09:11:43.137855+00:00", "round": 2, "hypothesis_id": "H013", "success": true, "summary": "Crossover重组算子(15%概率,Murcko骨架交换)显著提升BE: 最佳-9.755(vs H012 -9.335, +0.42), 平均-8.675(+0.13)。Trivial从1/10降至0/10。85个独特分子中crossover成功产生新化学型。文献: MOOSE-Chem/MolLEO进化算子理论。"}
    10	{"timestamp": "2026-05-18T13:41:21.997248+00:00", "round": 6, "hypothesis_id": "H014", "success": true, "summary": "H014 化学计量验证: 阈值 0.7-1.3 成功消除 Friedländer 规则误匹配（如取代喹啉 17atoms vs 无取代原料 12atoms = 1.42 被正确拒绝），路线回退到正确的 Suzuki 断键。最佳 BE -9.17（+3.1% vs R5），平均 -8.06（随机方差）。Trivial 比例保持 0.1 — 剩余 trivial 源自饱和双环骨架缺失规则，需 H015 解决。"}
    11	{"timestamp": "2026-05-18T14:06:13.526968+00:00", "round": 7, "hypothesis_id": "H015", "success": true, "summary": "H015: 饱和杂环断键规则 + _is_simple_molecule 修复。新增 6 条逆合成规则（THIQ、吲哚啉、四氢喹啉、饱和环 C-N 断键等），修复 _is_simple_molecule 误判多环芳烃为\"简单\"。Trivial ratio 首次达到 0/10（从 0.1 降至 0.0）。最佳 BE -9.074 kcal/mol，平均 -8.31 kcal/mol。H014+H015 组合实现零 trivial route。"}
