    13	{"timestamp": "2026-05-19T06:50:40.564365+00:00", "round": 11, "hypothesis_id": "H019", "success": false, "summary": "Combine strategy: best BE -9.335 (vs -9.292 R10, +0.4%), avg BE -8.581 (vs -8.609, -0.3%), trivial 1/10 (vs 0/10, regression). BE performance comparable to mutate, but trivial route regression due to novel BRICS-recombined scaffold (dibenzazepine) not covered by existing retrosynthesis rules."}
